2026-06-15 12:28:13,311 TITLE: The selection of pretreatment options for anaerobic digestion (AD): A case study in olive oil waste production Title of processing article
2026-06-15 12:28:21,834 {
  "pretreatments": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "description": "Dilution with tap water (WP test): The mixture of olive pomace and olive mill wastewater was diluted with tap water to achieve an approximate TS content of 10% w/w or a concentration of approximately 120 g/l when OP was diluted. This involved adding water to the feed mixture without any chemical or mechanical interventions."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "description": "Basic Pretreatment (BP): The addition of 2 N NaOH to the mixture until a pH of 12 was reached, followed by stirring at 70 rpm for 24 h at 30 ± 1 °C. The broth was then neutralized with 2 N HCl before inoculation."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "description": "Salt Pretreatment with FeSO4 (SP_FeII): Pre-acid cracking by treating the reaction medium with 2 N HCl until pH 2 was reached and mixing at ambient temperature for 30 min at 70 rpm. Then, FeSO4 was added to achieve a concentration of 5 g/L. The mixture was held at 70 rpm and 30 ± 1 °C for 24 h, followed by neutralization with 2 N NaOH."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "description": "Salt Pretreatment with FeCl3 (SP_FeIII): Pre-acid cracking by treating the reaction medium with 2 N HCl until pH 2 was reached and mixing at ambient temperature for 30 min at 70 rpm. Then, FeCl3 was added to achieve a concentration of 5 g/L. The mixture was held at 70 rpm and 30 ± 1 °C for 24 h, followed by neutralization with 2 N NaOH."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "description": "Salt Pretreatment with MnSO4 (SP_Mn): Pre-acid cracking by treating the reaction medium with 2 N HCl until pH 2 was reached and mixing at ambient temperature for 30 min at 70 rpm. Then, MnSO4·H2O was added to achieve a concentration of 5 g/L. The mixture was held at 70 rpm and 30 ± 1 °C for 24 h, followed by neutralization with 2 N NaOH."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
